<http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/A02/current/SmallCraftAdvisory/>
        rdf:type               skos:Concept;
        dce:identifier         "SDN:A02::SmallCraftAdvisory";
        dc:date                "2011-08-15 11:58:51.0";
        dc:identifier          "SDN:A02::SmallCraftAdvisory";
        pav:authoredOn         "2011-08-15 11:58:51.0";
        pav:hasCurrentVersion  <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/A02/current/SmallCraftAdvisory/1/>;
        pav:version            "1";
        void:inDataset         <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/.well-known/void>;
        owl:deprecated         "false";
        owl:versionInfo        "1";
        skos:altLabel          "";
        skos:broader           <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/A01/current/Mitigation_Strategies_and_Preparedness/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/A03/current/PublicHealth/>;
        skos:definition        "The Small Craft Advisory is a U.S. Coast Guard warning to small craft boaters in Coastal Waters and Nearshore areas of forecasts for sustained winds, frequent gusts, or sea/wave conditions that could be hazardous to small boats. On the west coast of the U.S. this type of advisory is issued when conditions exceed a threshold of sustained winds of 21 to 33 knots, potentially in combination with wave heights exceeding 10 feet."@en;
        skos:definition        "L'avis aux petites embarcations est une alerte de la Garde côtière américaine aux plaisanciers sur petits bateaux dans les eaux côtières et les zones riveraines, prévoyant des vents soutenus, des rafales fréquentes ou des conditions de mer/vagues qui pourraient être dangereuses pour les petits bateaux. Sur la côte ouest des États-Unis, ce type d'avis est émis lorsque les conditions dépassent un seuil de vents soutenus de 21 à 33 nœuds, potentiellement combinés à des hauteurs de vagues dépassant 3 mètres."@fr ;
        skos:inScheme          <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/scheme/ICANCOERO/current/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/scheme/OCACETHES/current/>;
        skos:notation          "SDN:A02::SmallCraftAdvisory";
        skos:note              "accepted"@en;
        skos:prefLabel         "Small Craft Advisory"@en ;
        skos:prefLabel         "Avis aux petites embarcations"@fr .

